flowchart TB
 Client["API consumer - no bundled frontend yet"]
 KC["Keycloak 26.8.2 - OIDC + Organizations"]
 Gateway["platform-api - NestJS"]
 PG[("PostgreSQL 18 + pgvector - tenant RLS, per-service DB roles")]
 Outbox["outbox-dispatcher - Go"]
 Temporal["Temporal server"]
 Worker["execution-worker - Go Temporal activities"]
 Supervisor["root-supervisor - TypeScript, SupervisorService"]
 Agent["ai-capabilities - Python, CapabilityService (safe-mock by default)"]
 Calendar["calendar-service - Go, CalendarService"]
 Context["context-engine - Go, ContextService"]
 DomainEvents["domain-events - Go, event consumer/inbox"]
 Integration["integration-service - Go, IntegrationService"]
 DocParser["document-parser - Go shim + Rust lawpilot-document-worker, profile: documents"]
 Clio["Clio Manage v4 / generic OAuth adapter"]
 S3[("Encrypted document storage - FILE_STORAGE_ENABLED")]
 Otel["OpenTelemetry collector"]

 Client -->|REST + bearer JWT| Gateway
 Client -.->|Authorization Code + PKCE| KC
 Gateway -.->|verify JWT, JWKS| KC
 Gateway -->|read/write, SQL grant checks| PG
 Gateway -->|gRPC + mTLS| Calendar
 Gateway -->|gRPC + mTLS| Context
 Gateway -->|gRPC + mTLS| Integration
 Gateway -->|accept + audit + outbox, same transaction| PG

 Outbox -->|lease rows| PG
 Outbox -->|start workflow by stable ID| Temporal
 Temporal <-->|activities| Worker
 Worker -->|reauthorize + load request| PG
 Worker -->|PrepareExecutionContext| Context
 Worker -->|ExecuteCapability over SupervisorService| Supervisor
 Supervisor -->|ExecuteCapability over CapabilityService, same request/response shape| Agent
 Worker -->|persist result + audit + outbox| PG

 Calendar --> PG
 Context --> PG
 DomainEvents -->|claim_domain_events, own leased journal - NOT the execution outbox| PG
 Integration --> PG
 Integration -->|Parse, mTLS, caller-scoped| DocParser
 Integration -->|encrypted OAuth tokens, AES-256-GCM| Clio
 Integration -.->|private bucket, server-side KMS| S3
 DocParser -->|IngestProcessed| Context

 Gateway -.-> Otel
 Worker -.-> Otel
 Supervisor -.-> Otel
 Agent -.-> Otel
 Calendar -.-> Otel
 Context -.-> Otel
 Integration -.-> Otel
